ac13|n|A genus of aquatic plants named in honor of Queen Victoria. The Victoria regia is a native of Guiana and Brazil. Its large, spreading leaves are often over five feet in diameter, and have a rim from three to five inches high; its immense rose-white flowers sometimes attain a diameter of nearly two feet. ; A kind of low four-wheeled pleasure carriage, with a calash top, designed for two persons and the driver who occupies a high seat in front. ; An asteroid discovered by Hind in 1850; -- called also Clio.	a:3lj2,155,9;3w5p,125,3;7my5,119,517;nbs,103,2;5pcw,97,7;6tus,62,3;5393,62,6;6ev0,49,11;aiin,47,5;42sd,24,3;75y,20,2;6lfq,10,9~7my5,119,517;6ev0,49,11;3lj2,155,9;6lfq,10,9;5pcw,97,7;5393,62,6;aiin,47,5;42sd,24,3;3w5p,125,3;6tus,62,3;nbs,103,2;75y,20,2	v:9f75,95,1;5393,85,31;9dv1,51,383;7my5,49,4;43l0,45,2;66d4,38,26;9gw6,8,2;1883,7,12;4epj,5,4~9dv1,51,383;5393,85,31;66d4,38,26;1883,7,12;7my5,49,4;4epj,5,4;9gw6,8,2;43l0,45,2;9f75,95,1	V:8hkb,131,2;3hic,123,1;3lj2,123,1;1vd3,121,1;45rx,109,1;7v7o,108,11;aqj,107,3;5gdf,106,10;9f75,105,2;u00,104,1;3yy0,103,7;8y5e,92,14;3yxq,67,2;2feo,66,24;aby1,65,1~9dv1,53,453;59kk,47,362;2feo,66,24;3ybi,28,20;ty7,49,16;8y5e,92,14;888b,10,12;7v7o,108,11;18lm,22,10;5gdf,106,10;5kyb,58,9;3pki,1,8;905g,29,8;1z95,31,8;7rm7,36,8	n:8hkb,131,2;ac13,120,57;1ns1,118,5;7v9m,115,2;3w5p,109,1;5bby,97,6;6ocb,95,21;9f75,95,1;1zft,92,31;5393,84,28;7ehj,83,11;62gt,81,9;6gua,73,1;5kgj,70,3;5pcw,69,1~ac13,120,57;1zft,92,31;5393,84,28;9dv1,10,23;6ocb,95,21;66b5,3,19;52of,57,19;6sdz,2,13;7ehj,83,11;5dru,61,10;62gt,81,9;75y,40,8;91jr,5,8;5bby,97,6;3h51,25,5	N:3hic,151,7;3qov,143,10;iom,129,17;3lj2,123,1;ac13,120,57;45rx,119,2;2u6b,116,5;8o5x,112,4;69jt,107,3;8y5e,105,34;m99,105,6;acpg,105,5;77kb,104,11;u00,104,1;647,100,7~ac13,120,57;8y5e,105,34;1z95,44,19;nji,75,19;59kk,4,18;35u5,57,18;iom,129,17;a2sy,48,15;3ybi,23,14;78m5,59,13;91tn,58,13;4bdu,39,11;2psv,90,11;77kb,104,11;26qr,18,11
